<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-18T06:09:44.180Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:09:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff are confronting gangs with support from a Kenya-led multinational mission, while Erik Prince has deployed Blackwater contractors using drones and air support to strike gangs. A secretive operation by Prince also involves an arms deal with Haitian police, linked to Dolly Parton’s nephew, a former lawmaker, and millions are reported missing. Bangladesh has begun pre-deploying a vanguard of soldiers as an advance team for the UN security mission in Haiti. The United Nations renewed sanctions on Haiti and added US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. There were 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168598&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE8tblkyTGdPd2dmUm1qOEU1a3p2Ty1WTVhyUjZTejFPN0hsUHJYM3NFQmhBTXNEUkdrN3FFY3NwZlh6VGtOdWlJNUJOYlQ4N3V5VEhDZXEwTFY5OEVDVGVObWVKTGNzNlUydVY3RmU3SUF3Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNZjZUQXVjYmZJM3FuMk01bnBGa3pyM0FQV09kY09OeHF1SUZqTGtheDZEaXE5VEViZTVULWs2M1d6QmMzVlZQVWZaX1AzbUFhVUZSXzVsXzV3UGNuQS10QXBhcnJLU2hxdVczTGdITHNwMURUdVd3N1BIM1AwUXgtd3FvaS1EVFZNSGdPTWVxOGJzUzNIZGZIbTRIZTc?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQdVpVbFZMc1BxSmVRcUZ1dXoyc0hEcnJVdzBFdTZxRUlUSS1VcFRFanl0R1czS09sOU5OQ1JnUWdQeXhBN2xpMWxFUEtqdHJreVdRTFNJUHJGV3VLSFhHVm16VV9Tc3pVcERxNEZlcENwdGlJUkFpVXNDWnIxZUJwSk1PbVdLcDZiVzBLa1JQT3gzVGNvQXdzMENzdHpUWmtVZ3VRVXZkUnk4cWpMNWFMeUtR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Talking Points Memo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQOXFPZlRpNE15dzBjMXd4b1lTRzJzMGR6ZlhNY21ZTjBGZ0l6S1BMRW1SWHJRZFdhMTNLZlgwM3lTajVjRlZCUk44RkdsemtiLW